WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.122
A ship climbs 26 metres.

00:00:02.132 --> 00:00:03.906
No pumps fill the locks.

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:05.292
Each original lock:

00:00:05.302 --> 00:00:08.330
a concrete box 320 metres long, gates

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.464
both ends.

00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:11.257
Close the gates behind the ship.

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.196
Open valves deep below.

00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:17.141
Through huge tunnels,
about 101,000 cubic metres

00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:18.924
pour into each chamber.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:21.140
At Gatun, three steps like this lift

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:22.879
it into Gatun Lake.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.313
What pushes the water in?

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.088
No pump.

00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:26.726
It runs down from the lake.

00:00:26.736 --> 00:00:28.398
Gravity lifts the ship.
